    - autoRecallMinScore gate (0.6 default, high precision)
    - 4 gm_* tools (gm_status / gm_search / gm_record / gm_stats)
    - Idempotent event IDs (HMR/resume safe)
    - SQLite + FTS5 + optional vector (DashScope/OpenAI/local providers)
    - Native DSH Cordis plugin lifecycle (no fork)

